    {
      "slug": "movah",
      "title": "Movah",
      "summary": "A mobile app to keep track of series, films and anime without losing the thread. Flutter on Android and iOS, with Supabase.",
      "lead": "A mobile app to keep track of series, films and anime without losing the thread. Flutter on Android and iOS, with Supabase.",
      "periodLabel": "Since July 2026",
      "client": "Personal project",
      "role": "Design and development",
      "place": "Android and iOS",
      "siteUrl": null,
      "techs": [
        "flutter",
        "dart",
        "supabase"
      ],
      "featured": true,
      "article": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Context"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "With so many streaming platforms, it is easy to forget where you are in a series or when the next episode comes out. Movah brings together what you are watching, what you want to watch and what is coming soon."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A personal project, taken from mockup to app, to see a complete mobile product through: accounts, data, sync and release on two platforms."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I did"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I designed the high-fidelity mockup, then built the Flutter app and its Supabase backend."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Tracking series, films and anime, episode by episode."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The catalogue and search, powered by the TMDB API."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "The upcoming release calendar, lists and statistics."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Sign-in with email, Google or Apple, in French and English."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Technical choices"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The app never calls TMDB directly: Supabase Edge Functions sit in between, with a cache in Postgres. The API key stays on the server, and screens keep showing the last known data if TMDB does not respond."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The code is organised by feature, in data, domain and presentation layers. Domain entities depend on neither Flutter nor Supabase, which keeps them easy to test; app state goes through Riverpod."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Outcome"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The app runs on Android and iOS, with light and dark themes true to the mockup."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Every change goes through GitHub Actions continuous integration: formatting, code analysis, tests, then the app build."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I learned"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Starting from a complete mockup before writing the first line saved a lot of back-and-forth: every screen already had its states, colours and copy."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Moving from Angular to Flutter showed me that the same ideas carry over between frameworks: small components and data that flows in one direction."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
