    {
      "slug": "rdi-manager",
      "title": "RDI Manager",
      "summary": "R&D activity tracking at Object as a Service: time, planning, metrics. I took over maintenance and modernised the Symfony and Vue.js application.",
      "lead": "R&D activity tracking at Object as a Service: time, planning, metrics. Symfony back end, Vue.js interface.",
      "periodLabel": "2023 — 2026",
      "client": "Object as a Service",
      "role": "Full-stack web developer",
      "place": "Remote",
      "siteUrl": null,
      "techs": [
        "symfony",
        "php",
        "vue"
      ],
      "featured": false,
      "article": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Context"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "RDI Manager is the internal tool that tracks R&D activity at Object as a Service: time spent on each project, the team's schedule and the metrics used to follow research projects."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The application pairs a Symfony back end with a Vue.js interface. It had been running for years on an old Symfony version. Every change took longer, and nobody dared touch the metrics calculation."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I did"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I took over maintenance of the tool, then its modernisation, without interrupting the team using it."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Upgrading PHP, Symfony and dependencies, step by step."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Tests on the metrics calculation before any change."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Rewriting the most fragile parts: time entry and calculations."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Fixes and features requested by the R&D team, on both the Symfony and Vue.js sides."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Technical choices"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A full rewrite would have frozen the tool for months. I chose a gradual migration: each step left the application usable, and tests checked that metrics stayed identical before and after."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The trade-off: a few older parts still live alongside the modernised code. They are isolated behind clear, documented interfaces so they can be replaced later."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Outcome"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The tool runs on a maintained Symfony version, and changes no longer risk breaking the metrics calculation."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The R&D team kept entering time and following its projects throughout the modernisation."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I learned"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Starting with tests was the best investment of the project: without them, every upgrade would have been a gamble."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Taking over someone else's code taught me to read before judging. Several oddities had a business reason that needed understanding before fixing them."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
