      "lead": "A custom CRM for Kodoka: interfaces, business rules and data management.",
      "periodLabel": "March — April 2023",
      "client": "Kodoka",
      "role": "Full-stack web developer",
      "place": "Joué-lès-Tours",
      "siteUrl": null,
      "techs": [
        "codeigniter",
        "php"
      ],
      "featured": false,
      "article": {
        "type": "doc",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Context"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Kodoka tracked its clients and sales conversations in separate files. Information was scattered and hard to share across the team."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The company wanted a simple CRM that fit the way it works, rather than a general-purpose tool that takes weeks to configure."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I did"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In two months, I designed and built the CRM with CodeIgniter 4, from the database to the screens."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "bulletList",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Client and contact records, with the history of exchanges."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Tracking sales opportunities, stage by stage."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Business rules: statuses, follow-ups and role-based permissions."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "listItem",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Importing existing data from the old files."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Technical choices"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "CodeIgniter 4 was lightweight and already known to the team who would take the tool over after me. For a two-month project, that mattered more than a fuller framework."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I kept a plain, server-rendered interface to deliver on time. Only the most used screens got a little JavaScript, to avoid page reloads."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Outcome"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The team finds clients, their contacts and the history of exchanges in one place, instead of separate files."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The code was handed over with setup and onboarding documentation, so the team could keep developing it."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What I learned"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I would have spent more time with users before modelling the data: two fields added at the end of the project would have been obvious after a morning of observation."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Delivering a whole project in two months taught me to split work into usable versions, rather than finishing everything at once."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
