                "text": "Data collected"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The website only collects data when you use the contact form: your name, your email address, the subject and content of your message, and your company name if you give it. To prevent abuse, a fingerprint of your IP address (never the address itself) is kept for one hour at most."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "attrs": {
              "level": 2
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Purpose and legal basis"
              }
            ]
